category: Utils
requires: cygwin libatomic1 libbrotlidec1 libbrotlienc1 libbz2_1 libpcre2_8_0 libssl3 libzstd1 zlib0
sdesc: "Implementation of an ICAP server (runtime)"
ldesc: "c-icap is an implementation of an ICAP server. It can be used with HTTP
proxies that support the ICAP protocol to implement content adaptation
and filtering services."
external-source: c-icap

